      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### START HERE - Yvann Longform Batch Generator\n1. Put your cue sheet text file in ComfyUI input, or use script_examples/longform_yvann_cuesheet.example.txt.\n2. Put the 2-hour music file in ComfyUI input.\n3. Edit script_path and audio_path below.\n4. Leave launch_now=true, then press Queue.\nThis workflow starts the longform job in the background. It auto-generates images for each timestamped batch and feeds them into the Yvann audio-reactive workflow."
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
